RECEIPT 06 — PATIENTS WERE IN THE CORPORATE DATASET

This is the surprising part.

Corporate IT did not merely contain:

employee HR data
vendor records
business correspondence

Medtronic's notifications explain that it collects information concerning patients with Medtronic medical devices for product-related updates and legal requirements.

That means corporate systems can still contain health-related information even when medical-device operational infrastructure remains segregated.

Conceptually:

MEDICAL DEVICE
     │
     ├── OPERATIONAL / SAFETY SYSTEM
     │
     └── PATIENT RELATIONSHIP DATA
              ↓
         CORPORATE IT

Those are different environments.

But both can contain healthcare-relevant information.

