THE 9M vs 3.834M RECEIPT

This is another perfect SecurityReceipts graphic.

SHINYHUNTERS CLAIM
     9M+
      ↓
COMPANY INVESTIGATION
      ↓
REGULATORY NOTIFICATION
   3,834,294

Do not conclude:

ShinyHunters lied.

Nine million records does not necessarily equal nine million individual people.

One person may have multiple records.

Datasets may contain duplicates.

Attackers may also exaggerate.

The correct conclusion:

The attacker claim and confirmed affected-person count measure different things and remain materially different.

That's precise.

WHY “RECORDS” IS A TERRIBLE BREACH METRIC

